    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nDescribe the temporal progression of alcohol withdrawal symptoms\n\n(1) 08-12 hrs: Insomnia and autonomic instability\n(2)12-48 hrs: Seizures\n\n(3) 48-96 hrs: Delirium tremens\n\n[Image: 555fd00d258e527a1bae2fa25808fb22adfb121210a139937eea34f651be811a]\n\n[Image: 0fa55e1bc3fb2cd95dbc1338f8eb70bf496d876b7b608567bfe5fd10e46ec4bb]\n\n[Image: 095339569afe0272b1975a2897075948b7d9355d16e97cbcbb26568ec3dce113]\n\n1.1 - Benzodiazepines, flumazenil\n[Image: 4e88ed21ceda3eb601f618c259757a8a2e401804886af1e0a5a9e1f16a790e53]\n\n[Image: a66eed6c418709be79b1062e66a75dc7471c835fc46e5408c2303b5aaed14da5]\n\n[Image: 352c5155b8c949365e5a2e11e524f0170920455bbb8b8f89e7695d2bd33ca3d6]\n\n[Image: 0a123cff24ff7c544e384d03a0212151daeee6ed9b5a680e03395364d78deaa4]",
